Base image and system packages
------------------------------
The openGauss Dockerfiles use openeuler/openeuler:22.03-lts as a final
base image. Dockerfile.arm installs the following final-stage packages:
readline-devel, libseccomp-devel, ca-certificates, openssl, unzip, curl,
procps-ng, vim, libaio-devel, numactl-devel, lapack, openblas, libxml2, shadow.
compute/compute-node-opengauss.arm.Dockerfile installs:
ca-certificates, gdb, iproute, libcurl, libevent, lz4, libuuid, readline,
libxml2, libxslt, libzstd, libaio, libedit, lapack, ncurses-libs,
numactl-libs, openblas, glibc-common, glibc-locale-source, perl, lsof,
procps, screen, tcpdump, vim, jq, nmap, libicu, shadow, findutils.
Dockerfile.arm also downloads AWS CLI v2 without pinning a version.
Consult the exact built image's package database and the respective
upstream license files for version-specific system package notices.

